{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は沈金でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/1968226/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは\nMrs. GREEN APPLEから\n大森元貴さんと若井滉斗さんが\n来て下さいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの女の子たち\nみんな可愛かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/1968226/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハタチという若さでもう将来性しかない！\nこれから更に人気になっていくんだろうな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＰＯＷＥＲ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/1968226/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n中田のフリースタイル川柳\nという新コーナーをお試ししてみました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...まあ、1回きりですかね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/1968226/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、途中から\nリスナーに電話しちゃう、という"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また神回になっちゃいましたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電話出てくださったみなさん\n本当にありがとうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと！\n乃木坂46 ジャージ再販するらしい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待望の！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木ジャーについてのコメントは\n絶対にシェアラジオしないでね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/1968226/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対にね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/1968226/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『のぎ天2＃11』\t配信されました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/1968226/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のメンバーは\n純奈、かわたん、ゆったん、愛未、ちま、中田です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィンの余韻で\nコスプレしちゃってますよん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/1968226/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは\n握手会のときのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n乃木のの公開録音イベント\n富士急でやっちゃいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/1968226/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんできまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/05/1968226/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}